
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a1020">
  <meta name="description" content="A vision for a diversified organization that builds businesses, explores new technologies, and adapts to emerging opportunities.">
  <title>Infinity Group — Build Beyond Today</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a1020;
      --panel: #111b30;
      --text: #f4f7ff;
      --muted: #a9b5ca;
      --accent: #83e0c0;
      --line: #26344b;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .container {
      width: min(1100px, 90%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      background: rgba(10, 16, 32, .95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    }

    nav {
      min-height: 72px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 12px 0;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
    }

    .brand span { color: var(--accent); }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
      font-size: .9rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .nav-links a:hover,
    .text-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }

    .hero {
      padding: 90px 0 76px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 20%,
          rgba(77, 147, 180, .20), transparent 45%);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-size: .78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 9vw, 5.8rem);
      line-height: 1.03;
      letter-spacing: -.055em;
      margin: 20px 0;
      max-width: 850px;
    }

    h1 span { color: var(--accent); }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.08rem;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 19px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .button.primary {
      color: #071a16;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    section { padding: 65px 0; }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.7rem);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 10px 0 15px;
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 680px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .card .symbol {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; }

    .card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .95rem;
    }

    .statement {
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 8px 0 8px 22px;
      max-width: 800px;
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 1.8rem);
    }

    .steps {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .step {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 55px 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 20px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .number {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 850;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .step h3 { margin: 0 0 5px; }
    .step p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }

    .notice {
      background: #101a2c;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 16px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .88rem;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 30px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .85rem;
    }

    .footer-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .hero { padding: 65px 0 55px; }
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .nav-links { gap: 12px; }
      section { padding: 48px 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a class="brand" href="#home">INFINITY<span>.</span></a>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="#vision">Vision</a>
          <a href="#businesses">Businesses</a>
          <a href="#roadmap">Roadmap</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">A vision for what comes next</div>
        <h1>Build beyond<br><span>today.</span></h1>
        <p>
          We envision a diversified organization that builds strong
          businesses, explores emerging technologies, and creates
          new opportunities as the world changes.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="#vision">Discover our vision</a>
          <a class="button" href="#businesses">Explore our model</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="vision">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">Our founding philosophy</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Never limited to one industry.</h2>
        <p class="intro">
          Industries evolve. Technologies change. New problems create
          new markets. Our long-term vision is to build an organization
          capable of adapting, learning, and creating businesses
          across generations.
        </p>
        <div class="statement">
          Own valuable businesses. Discover new possibilities.
          Build what the future needs.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="businesses">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">Our future portfolio</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">One vision. Many possibilities.</h2>
        <p class="intro">
          These are potential areas of exploration, not a claim
          that we already operate in these industries.
        </p>

        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="symbol">◈</div>
            <h3>Technology & AI</h3>
            <p>
              Develop useful software, intelligent systems,
              automation, and digital infrastructure.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="symbol">⌁</div>
            <h3>Commerce & Services</h3>
            <p>
              Build businesses that solve customer problems
              and deliver measurable value.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="symbol">◎</div>
            <h3>Media & Knowledge</h3>
            <p>
              Explore publishing, education, communication,
              and knowledge-based businesses.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="symbol">✳</div>
            <h3>Future Ventures</h3>
            <p>
              Investigate emerging markets and turn promising
              opportunities into new businesses.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="roadmap">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow">How we intend to grow</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Start small. Think long term.</h2>

        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step">
            <div class="number">01</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Establish</h3>
              <p>Start with a practical business that solves a real problem.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step">
            <div class="number">02</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Strengthen</h3>
              <p>Build customer trust, reliable operations, and sustainable revenue.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step">
            <div class="number">03</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Innovate</h3>
              <p>Test new ideas and invest in opportunities supported by evidence.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="step">
            <div class="number">04</div>
            <div>
              <h3>Expand</h3>
              <p>Create or acquire additional businesses when the time is right.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="notice">
          <strong>Early-stage concept</strong><br>
          Infinity Group is a provisional project name used to
          develop this concept website. The organization, its
          divisions, and its future ventures are aspirational.
          This page does not claim existing operations or customers.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-row">
      <span>INFINITY GROUP · BUILD BEYOND TODAY</span>
      <span>© <span id="year">2026</span> · Concept website</span>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
